bind Report Animal Abuse: Abuse Severity, Animal Species, Animal Age
bind Investigate Abuse Case: Abuse Severity, Animal Health
bind Rescue Abused Animal: Animal Health, Animal Species
bind Provide Veterinary Care: Animal Health, Checkup Frequency
bind Find Foster Home: Shelter Capacity
bind Screen for Adoption: Adoption Status
bind Finalize Animal Adoption: Animal Species, Animal Age
bind Monitor Animal Welfare: Animal Health
bind Process Donation: Donation Amount
bind Apply for Volunteering: Volunteer Background Check
Abuse Severity: Low, Medium, High
Animal Species: Dog, Cat, Other
Animal Age: integer between 0 and 25
Animal Health: Healthy, Injured, Sick
Shelter Capacity: integer between 0 and 500
Adoption Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Donation Amount: float between 1.0 and 10000.0
Volunteer Background Check: Pass, Fail
Checkup Frequency: integer between 7 and 365
